</p><h1>Yoga mats &amp; props the studios buy — at factory-direct prices</h1><p class='sub'>We make and source our own gear, so you get commercial-grade quality without the retail markup. One mat or 300 for your studio — same care, same day shipping.</p><ul class='ticks'><li>Free shipping on orders over $75</li><li>60-day no-hassle returns</li><li>Ships same business day (order by 2pm ET)</li><li>Volume discounts up to 40% for studios &amp; events</li></ul><div class='ctas'><a class='btn' href='shop.html'>Shop bestsellers</a><a class='btn alt' href='bulk-orders.html'>Get bulk pricing →</a></div><p class='mini'>★★★★★ 4.8/5 from 11,400+ verified customer reviews</p></div><div class='hcard'><span class='pill'>Most popular</span><h3 style='margin-top:12px'>Studio Starter Kit</h3><p style='color:#5F6B66;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:15px'>1/2\\\" Deluxe mat + 2 foam blocks + 8ft cotton strap</p><div class='price'>$54.95<span class='was'>$79.85</span><span class='save'>Save 31%</span></div><div class='rate'>★★★★★ <span>(1,908 reviews)</span></div><div style='margin-top:14px'><button class='btn w' data-n='Studio Starter Kit' onclick='addToCart(this)'>Add to cart — free shipping</button><a class='btn alt w' style='margin-top:10px' href='product-deluxe-mat.html'>See what is included</a></div><div class='stats'><div><b>25+</b><span>Years in yoga</span></div><div><b>1M+</b><span>Mats shipped</span></div><div><b>4,000+</b><span>Studios served</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec' style='padding:26px 0 0'><div class='wrap'><div class='vp'><div><b>🏭 Made &amp; sourced by us</b>No middleman markup</div><div><b>🚚 Fast, free shipping</b>Free over $75, flat $6.95 under</div><div><b>↩️ 60-day returns</b>Even on opened mats</div><div><b>🧾 Net-30 for studios</b>PO &amp; invoicing available</div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><h2>Shop by what you need</h2><p class='sub'>Everything for a class, a studio refresh, or a home practice.</p><div class='tiles'><a class='tile' href='shop.html'><i>🧘</i><div><b>Yoga Mats</b><small>From $16.95 · 1/8\\\" to 1/2\\\" thick</small></div></a><a class='tile' href='shop.html#props'><i>🧱</i><div><b>Blocks &amp; Wedges</b><small>Foam, cork &amp; bulk cases</small></div></a><a class='tile' href='shop.html#props'><i>🪢</i><div><b>Straps &amp; Slings</b><small>6ft, 8ft, 10ft cotton</small></div></a><a class='tile' href='shop.html#props'><i>🛏️</i><div><b>Bolsters &amp; Cushions</b><small>Restorative &amp; meditation</small></div></a><a class='tile' href='shop.html#props'><i>🧺</i><div><b>Blankets &amp; Towels</b><small>Mexican-style &amp; microfiber</small></div></a><a class='tile' href='bulk-orders.html'><i>📦</i><div><b>Studio Bulk Packs</b><small>Save up to 40% · quote today</small></div></a></div></div></section><section class='sec cream' id='best'><div class='wrap'><h2>This week&rsquo;s bestsellers</h2><p class='sub'>Trusted by studios, schools, hotels and home practitioners for over two decades.</p><div class='grid g4'><div class='card'><div class='ph'><span class='pill'>#1 Bestseller</span>🧘</div><div class='cb'><h3>Deluxe 1/2\\\" Extra Thick Mat</h3><div class='rate'>★★★★★ <span>(2,431)</span></div><div class='price'>$34.95<span class='was'>$44.95</span></div><div class='mt'><button class='btn sm w' data-n='Deluxe 1/2\\\" Mat' onclick='addToCart(this)'>Add to cart</button><a href='product-deluxe-mat.html' style='display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:13.5px;color:#2F6B5E;font-weight:700'>View details</a></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>🧺</div><div class='cb'><h3>Premium Cotton Yoga Blanket</h3><div class='rate'>★★★★★ <span>(1,204)</span></div><div class='price'>$19.95<span class='was'>$26.95</span></div><div class='mt'><button class='btn sm w' data-n='Cotton Yoga Blanket' onclick='addToCart(this)'>Add to cart</button><span style='display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5F6B66'>Case of 12: $179 (save 25%)</span></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>🧱</div><div class='cb'><h3>Foam Yoga Block — 2 Pack</h3><div class='rate'>★★★★☆ <span>(3,067)</span></div><div class='price'>$14.95<span class='was'>$19.95</span></div><div class='mt'><button class='btn sm w' data-n='Foam Block 2-Pack' onclick='addToCart(this)'>Add to cart</button><span style='display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5F6B66'>Case of 20: $99 (save 34%)</span></div></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'><span class='pill'>Best value</span>📦</div><div class='cb'><h3>Studio Starter Kit (Mat + Blocks + Strap)</h3><div class='rate'>★★★★★ <span>(1,908)</span></div><div class='price'>$54.95<span class='was'>$79.85</span><span class='save'>-31%</span></div><div class='mt'><button class='btn sm w' data-n='Studio Starter Kit' onclick='addToCart(this)'>Add to cart</button><span style='display:block;text-align:center;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;color:#5F6B66'>Ships free today</span></div></div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:26px'><a class='btn alt' href='shop.html'>Shop all mats &amp; props</a></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='quote'><div class='grid g2' style='align-items:start'><div><h2>Buying for a studio, school, gym or event?</h2><p style='color:#C7D3CF;font-size:17px'>Tell us what you need and we&rsquo;ll send a written quote with volume pricing, freight cost and lead time — usually within one business day. Net-30 terms, POs and tax-exempt orders welcome.</p><ul class='ticks' style='color:#EAF1EF'><li style='color:#EAF1EF'>Save 15–40% versus single-unit pricing</li><li style='color:#EAF1EF'>Dedicated rep for reorders &amp; new locations</li><li style='color:#EAF1EF'>Custom logo mats &amp; retail-ready packaging</li></ul></div><div style='background:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:22px;color:#1E2A26'><h3>Get my bulk quote</h3><p style='font-size:14px;color:#5F6B66;margin:0'>No obligation. Real human reply, not a catalog.</p><form class='qf' id='qform' onsubmit='return fq(event)'><input class='full' placeholder='Full name' required><input placeholder='Email' type='email' required><input placeholder='Phone (optional)'><input class='full' placeholder='Studio / organization'><select class='full'><option>What do you need? (select)</option><option>Yoga mats</option><option>Blocks / straps / bolsters</option><option>Blankets / towels</option><option>Custom logo products</option><option>Full studio outfit</option></select><select class='full'><option>Estimated quantity</option><option>10–24 units</option><option>25–99 units</option><option>100–299 units</option><option>300+ units</option></select><button class='btn w full' type='submit'>Send my quote request</button></form><div id='qok' style='display:none;background:#EEF4F2;border-radius:10px;padding:18px;margin-top:14px'><b>Thanks — your request is in.</b><p style='margin:6px 0 0;font-size:14px;color:#4A5551'>A YogaDirect rep will email your quote within 1 business day. Need it faster? Call <b>1-800-555-9642</b>, Mon–Fri 9–6 ET.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class='sec cream'><div class='wrap'><h2>What customers say</h2><p class='sub'>11,400+ reviews · 4.8 average · verified buyers</p><div class='grid g3'><div class='tst'><div class='rate'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;We outfitted 42 spots for our new studio for less than half of what our old supplier quoted. Mats arrived in three days and have held up through two years of hot classes.&rdquo;</p><b>Marisa L.</b><small>Owner, Riverstone Yoga · Austin, TX</small></div><div class='tst'><div class='rate'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;The 1/2\\\" mat is the only one that spares my knees. Ordered three more for family. Returns were painless when I wanted a different color.&rdquo;</p><b>Dan R.</b><small>Home practitioner · verified buyer</small></div><div class='tst'><div class='rate'>★★★★★</div><p>&ldquo;Our district ordered 300 mats on a PO with net-30 terms. Our rep handled everything and the freight quote was accurate to the dollar.&rdquo;</p><b>Angela P.</b><small>Wellness Coordinator, Public Schools</small></div></div></div></section><section class='sec'><div class='wrap'><div class='nl'><h2>Take 10% off your first order</h2><p style='color:#4A5551;margin:0'>Join 90,000+ yogis for new-product drops, restock alerts and subscriber-only bundle pricing.</p><form class='nlf' onsubmit='return nl(event)'><input type='email' placeholder='you@email.com' required><button class='btn' type='submit'>Get my 10% code</button></form><p style='font-size:12.5px;color:#5F6B66;margin:0' id='nlmsg'>One or two emails a month. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></div></section><section class='sec' style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:840px'><h2>Questions before you order?</h2><div class='fq' onclick='tg(this)'><b>How fast will my order ship?</b><p>In-stock orders placed by 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Most deliveries arrive in 2–5 business days. Bulk and freight orders ship within 1–3 business days of quote approval.</p></div><div class='fq' onclick='tg(this)'><b>What does shipping cost?</b><p>Free on orders over $75. Flat $6.95 under $75 in the contiguous US. Bulk orders get a real freight quote up front — no surprises at checkout.</p></div><div class='fq' onclick='tg(this)'><b>Can I return a mat I&rsquo;ve used?</b><p>Yes. Try it for 60 days. If it isn&rsquo;t right, contact us for a return label and a full refund or exchange, even if the mat has been unrolled and used.</p></div><div class='fq' onclick='tg(this)'><b>Do you offer wholesale or studio pricing?</b><p>We do — tiered discounts start at 10 units and reach up to 40% off at higher volumes, with net-30 terms available for approved studios, schools and municipalities. <a href='bulk-orders.html' style='color:#2F6B5E;font-weight:700'>Request a quote</a>.</p></div><div class='fq' onclick='tg(this)'><b>Can you print our studio logo?</b><p>Yes. Custom logo mats, towels and bags start at 50 units with digital proofs before production. Ask for custom pricing in your quote request.</p></div></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fgrid'><div><a class='logo' href='index.html' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8FC5B5'>Direct</span></a><p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. Faithfully supplying the yoga community since 1999.</p><p><b style='color:#fff'>1-800-555-9642</b><br>Mon–Fri 9am–6pm ET · help@yogadirect.com</p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='shop.html'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Blocks &amp; straps</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#props'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li><li><a href='shop.html#kits'>Kits &amp; bundles</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>For business</h4><ul><li><a href='bulk-orders.html'>Bulk &amp; wholesale</a></li><li><a href='bulk-orders.html'>Custom logo products</a></li><li><a href='bulk-orders.html'>Net-30 &amp; PO orders</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>About YogaDirect</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='index.html#best'>Shipping info</a></li><li><a href='index.html'>60-day returns</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Contact us</a></li><li><a href='about.html'>Track my order</a></li></ul></div></div><div class='fbot'><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Shop Pay</span></div></div></footer><div class='mob'><a class='btn alt' style='flex:1' href='bulk-orders.html'>Bulk quote</a><a class='btn' style='flex:1' href='shop.html'>Shop now</a></div><div id='toast'></div><script>function addToCart(el){var c=document.getElementById('cc');c.textContent=parseInt(c.textContent||0)+1;var t=document.getElementById('toast');t.textContent='✓ '+(el.getAttribute('data-n')||'Item')+' added to cart';t.style.display='block';clearTimeout(window._t);window._t=setTimeout(function(){t.style.display='none'},2600);}function fq(e){e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('qform').style.display='none';document.getElementById('qok').style.display='block';return false;}function tg(el){el.classList.toggle('open');}function nl(e){e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('nlmsg').innerHTML='<b style=\\\"color:#2F6B5E\\\">Check your inbox — your 10% code is on the way.</b>';return false;}</script></body></html>\"},{\"path\":\"/shop.html\",\"html\":\"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang='en'><head><meta charset='utf-8'><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'><title>Shop Yoga Mats, Blocks, Straps &amp; Props | YogaDirect</title><meta name='description' content='Shop manufacturer-direct yoga mats, blocks, straps, bolsters, blankets and studio kits. Free shipping over $75, 60-day returns, bulk case pricing on every prop.'><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1E2A26;background:#fff;line-height:1.55}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 20px}.bar{background:#2F6B5E;color:#fff;font-size:13.5px;text-align:center;padding:10px 14px}.bar b{color:#FFD79A}header.hd{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E0D6}.hdin{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:13px 0}.logo{font-weight:800;font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.6px;white-space:nowrap}.logo span{color:#2F6B5E}nav.main{display:flex;gap:20px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;flex:1;flex-wrap:wrap}nav.main a:hover{color:#2F6B5E}.hdact{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}.cart{border:1px solid #E7E0D6;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 13px}.btn{display:inline-block;background:#E2653E;color:#fff;font-weight:700;padding:15px 28px;border-radius:9px;border:0;cursor:pointer;font-size:16px;text-align:center;font-family:inherit}.btn:hover{background:#C9512C}.btn.alt{background:#fff;color:#2F6B5E;border:2px solid #2F6B5E}.btn.sm{