, and buy one or one hundred.</p><ul class='perks'><li>&#10003; Ships in 1&ndash;2 business days</li><li>&#10003; 30-day returns</li><li>&#10003; Mixed-color bulk orders</li><li>&#10003; POs accepted from schools &amp; studios</li></ul></div></section><div class='wrap layout'><aside class='side'><div class='box'><h4>Thickness</h4><label><input type='checkbox'> 1/8&quot; travel</label><label><input type='checkbox' checked> 1/4&quot; standard</label><label><input type='checkbox'> 1/2&quot; extra thick</label></div><div class='box'><h4>Category</h4><label><input type='checkbox' checked> Mats</label><label><input type='checkbox' checked> Blocks &amp; wedges</label><label><input type='checkbox' checked> Straps</label><label><input type='checkbox' checked> Bolsters</label><label><input type='checkbox' checked> Blankets &amp; towels</label></div><div class='box'><h4>Price</h4><label><input type='checkbox'> Under $10</label><label><input type='checkbox'> $10&ndash;$25</label><label><input type='checkbox'> $25&ndash;$50</label><label><input type='checkbox'> Bulk packs</label></div><div class='helpbox'><b>Not sure which mat?</b><p>Tell us your class style and floor type &mdash; we&rsquo;ll recommend the right thickness and grip in minutes.</p><a class='btn btn-p btn-sm' href='tel:18005034426'>Call 1-800-503-4426</a></div></aside><div><div class='band' id='deals'><div><h2>Buying 10 or more?</h2><p>Get tiered pricing, freight rates and color availability in one same-day quote.</p></div><a class='btn btn-p' href='/pages/wholesale'>Get my bulk quote &rarr;</a></div><div class='tools'><span>Showing 9 of 9 products</span><select aria-label='Sort'><option>Sort: Bestselling</option><option>Price: low to high</option><option>Price: high to low</option><option>Top rated</option><option>Newest</option></select></div><div class='grid'><article class='card'><div class='ph' style='background:#6f8f6b'><span class='tag'>Bestseller</span><svg viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke-width='1.4'