n<li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Mats</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Props</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Studio Packs</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n<li><a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Contact</a></li>\\n</ul>\\n<div class=\\\"spacer\\\"></div>\\n<div class=\\\"navcta\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"phone\\\" href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\">(800) 555-1234<small>Mon–Fri 9–5 PT · real humans</small></a>\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</header>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container hero-grid\\\">\\n<div>\\n<span class=\\\"eyebrow\\\">Manufacturer-direct pricing · No membership, no minimums</span>\\n<h1>Yoga mats &amp; props at direct prices — trusted since 1999.</h1>\\n<p class=\\\"lead\\\">We make and source our own gear, so studios, schools, therapists and home practitioners get high-quality mats, blocks, straps and bolsters for less. Order 1 or 1,000.</p>\\n<div class=\\\"hero-ctas\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Shop bestsellers →</a>\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Get bulk pricing</a>\\n</div>\\n<p class=\\\"micro\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> <strong>4.8/5</strong> from 9,200+ verified customers &nbsp;·&nbsp; 60-day returns &nbsp;·&nbsp; Ships same day before 1pm PT</p>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"hero-card\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"hero-visual\\\">Studio Starter Pack — save 32%</div>\\n<ul>\\n<li>10 mats + 10 blocks + 10 straps</li>\\n<li>Priced for studios, gyms &amp; schools</li>\\n<li>Free freight quote in under 1 business day</li>\\n<li>Net-30 terms available for schools</li>\\n</ul>\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-dark btn-block\\\" href=\\\"/product.html\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:16px\\\">See pack pricing</a>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<div class=\\\"trustrow\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">🏭</div><div><b>We manufacture it</b><span>Direct pricing, no middleman</span></div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">🚚</div><div><b>Free shipping $75+</b><span>Same-day dispatch, US warehouse</span></div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">↩️</div><div><b>60-day returns</b><span>Risk-free, no restocking fees</span></div></div>\\n<div class=\\\"trust\\\"><div class=\\\"ico\\\">📞</div><div><b>Talk to a human</b><span>25 years of studio experience</span></div></div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section>\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"sec-head\\\"><h2>Shop by category</h2><p>Everything you need to outfit a practice or a whole studio floor.</p></div>\\n<div class=\\\"cats\\\">\\n<a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\"><div class=\\\"im\\\"></div><div class=\\\"tx\\\"><b>Yoga Mats</b><span>From $19.95 →</span></div></a>\\n<a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\"><div class=\\\"im\\\"></div><div class=\\\"tx\\\"><b>Blocks &amp; Wedges</b><span>From $8.95 →</span></div></a>\\n<a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\"><div class=\\\"im\\\"></div><div class=\\\"tx\\\"><b>Straps &amp; Bolsters</b><span>From $9.95 →</span></div></a>\\n<a class=\\\"cat\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\"><div class=\\\"im\\\"></div><div class=\\\"tx\\\"><b>Studio Bulk Packs</b><span>Save up to 32% →</span></div></a>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"sec-head\\\"><h2>Best sellers this month</h2><p>Studio-tested favorites — every item includes automatic bulk discounts at checkout.</p></div>\\n<div class=\\\"grid4\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"tag\\\">Save 29%</span><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Classic Yoga Mat 1/8\\\"</h3><div class=\\\"rate\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> 4.8 (2,143)</div><div class=\\\"price\\\">$19.95 <s>$27.95</s></div><div class=\\\"bulknote\\\">10+ from $16.95 each</div><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-block btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/product.html\\\">Choose color</a></div>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\"><span class=\\\"tag g\\\">Studio pick</span><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Deluxe Yoga Mat 1/4\\\"</h3><div class=\\\"rate\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> 4.9 (1,088)</div><div class=\\\"price\\\">$29.95 <s>$39.95</s></div><div class=\\\"bulknote\\\">10+ from $24.95 each</div><a class=\\\"btn btn-primary btn-block btn-sm\\\" href=\\\"/product.html\\\">Choose color</a></div>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>Foam Yoga Block (4x6x9)</h3><div class=\\\"rate\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★☆</span> 4.7 (912)</div><div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.95</div><div class=\\\"bulknote\\\">20+ from $6.45 each</div><button class=\\\"btn btn-dark btn-block btn-sm add\\\">Add to cart</button></div>\\n<div class=\\\"card\\\"><div class=\\\"ph\\\"></div><h3>8ft Cotton Yoga Strap</h3><div class=\\\"rate\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span> 4.8 (764)</div><div class=\\\"price\\\">$9.95</div><div class=\\\"bulknote\\\">20+ from $6.95 each</div><button class=\\\"btn btn-dark btn-block btn-sm add\\\">Add to cart</button></div>\\n</div>\\n<div style=\\\"text-align:center;margin-top:28px\\\"><a class=\\\"btn btn-ghost\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">View all 120+ products →</a></div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"wholesale split\\\">\\n<div>\\n<h2>Outfitting a studio, school or gym?</h2>\\n<p>Tell us how many mats you need and we'll send a quote — usually within one business day.</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Tiered pricing that beats retail by up to 45%</li>\\n<li>Free freight quotes &amp; palletized shipping</li>\\n<li>Net-30 terms for schools, hospitals &amp; government</li>\\n<li>Custom logo printing on mats &amp; blocks</li>\\n</ul>\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Request a free quote</a>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"tiers\\\">\\n<h4 style=\\\"margin-bottom:10px;font-size:16px\\\">Example: Classic Yoga Mat 1/8\\\"</h4>\\n<table>\\n<tr><td>1–9 mats</td><td>$19.95 ea</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>10–24 mats</td><td>$16.95 ea</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>25–49 mats</td><td>$14.95 ea</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>50–99 mats</td><td>$12.95 ea</td></tr>\\n<tr><td>100+ mats</td><td>Custom quote</td></tr>\\n</table>\\n<p style=\\\"font-size:13px;opacity:.85;margin-top:12px\\\">Discounts apply automatically in cart. No account or membership required.</p>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"sec-head\\\"><h2>What customers say</h2><p>25 years, thousands of studios, one very sticky mat.</p></div>\\n<div class=\\\"revs\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"rev\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>\\\"We replaced 40 mats for our studio floor and paid less than half of what our old supplier charged. Shipped in three days.\\\"</p><b>Marisol T.</b><span>Studio owner, Austin TX</span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"rev\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>\\\"Ordered 120 mats and 120 blocks for our district's PE program. The quote came back the same day and they handled the freight.\\\"</p><b>Dan R.</b><span>School district buyer, OH</span></div>\\n<div class=\\\"rev\\\"><span class=\\\"stars\\\">★★★★★</span><p>\\\"Bought one mat to test quality before a bulk order — it's thicker and grippier than the boutique mat I paid $80 for.\\\"</p><b>Priya K.</b><span>Yoga teacher, Seattle WA</span></div>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"emailbox\\\">\\n<h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2>\\n<p>Join 40,000+ practitioners and studio owners. New-arrival alerts, bulk deals, no spam.</p>\\n<form class=\\\"inline\\\" onsubmit=\\\"event.preventDefault();this.innerHTML='<p style=&quot;font-weight:700;color:#0f6b63&quot;>✓ Check your inbox — your 10% code is on the way.</p>'\\\">\\n<input type=\\\"email\\\" required placeholder=\\\"you@email.com\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n<button class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">Send my code</button>\\n</form>\\n</div>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container faq\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"sec-head\\\"><h2>Questions, answered</h2></div>\\n<details open><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p>Orders placed before 1pm PT on business days ship the same day from our US warehouse. Most customers receive standard delivery in 2–5 business days. Bulk/freight orders ship within 1–3 business days.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Do I need an account or minimum order for wholesale pricing?</summary><p>No. Tiered bulk pricing applies automatically in your cart. For orders of 100+ units, custom logo work, or Net-30 terms, request a quote and a real person will reply within one business day.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>What if the product isn't right?</summary><p>Return any unused item within 60 days for a full refund — no restocking fees. Studios can request a single sample mat before committing to a bulk order.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Are your mats latex-free / phthalate-free?</summary><p>Yes. Our standard PVC mats are latex-free and 6P phthalate-free, and we offer TPE and natural rubber options for eco-conscious studios.</p></details>\\n<details><summary>Can you print our studio logo on mats?</summary><p>We do custom logo printing on mats, blocks and straps with a 50-unit minimum. Send your artwork with a quote request for pricing and turnaround.</p></details>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section style=\\\"padding-top:0\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\" style=\\\"background:#f7f4ee;border-radius:20px;padding:36px;text-align:center\\\">\\n<h2 style=\\\"font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.6px;margin-bottom:10px\\\">Thanks to our loyal customers since 1999</h2>\\n<p style=\\\"max-width:820px;margin:0 auto 20px;color:#4b5b59;font-size:16.5px\\\">YogaDirect is one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop with us you help grow your practice, your business, and the yoga community as a whole. From our team of yoga lovers to you — thank you.</p>\\n<a class=\\\"btn btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Start shopping</a>\\n</div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n<div class=\\\"container\\\">\\n<div class=\\\"fgrid\\\">\\n<div>\\n<div class=\\\"logo\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Yoga<span style=\\\"color:#f2b71d\\\">Direct</span></div>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-top:10px;max-width:280px\\\">Manufacturer-direct yoga mats and props for studios, schools and home practice since 1999.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\"><a href=\\\"tel:18005551234\\\" style=\\\"color:#fff;font-weight:700\\\">(800) 555-1234</a><br>help@yogadirect.com</p>\\n</div>\\n<div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Blocks &amp; wedges</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Straps &amp; bolsters</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/shop.html\\\">Studio bulk packs</a></li></ul></div>\\n<div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Wholesale &amp; bulk</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Schools &amp; government</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/wholesale.html\\\">Custom logo printing</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Request a quote</a></li></ul></div>\\n<div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Contact us</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/index.html#faq\\\">Shipping &amp; returns</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Order status</a></li><li><a href=\\\"/contact.html\\\">Bulk freight quotes</a></li></ul></div>\\n</div>\\n<div class=\\\"fbot\\\"><span>© 1999–2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.</span><span>Secure checkout · Visa · Mastercard · Amex · PayPal · Purchase orders accepted</span></div>\\n</div>\\n</footer>\\n\\n<div class=\\\