o-mat'>Yoga Mats</a><a href='/shop'>Props</a><a href='/wholesale'>Studio &amp; Bulk</a><a href='/about'>About &amp; Contact</a></nav><div class='hd-r'><a class='phone' href='tel:18005550199'>(800) 555-0199</a><a class='btn btn-primary sm' href='/shop'>Shop Best Sellers</a><button class='cart' onclick='openCart()' aria-label='Open cart'>Cart <span id='cartCount'>0</span></button></div></div></header><div class='hero'><div class='wrap hero-g'><div><span class='eyebrow'>Manufacturer-direct since 1999</span><h1>Studio-quality yoga gear at manufacturer-direct prices.</h1><p class='lead'>We make and source our own mats, blocks, straps and bolsters &mdash; so you get gear that survives 20 classes a week, without the boutique markup. One of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country.</p><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn btn-primary' href='/shop'>Shop Best Sellers</a><a class='btn btn-out' href='/wholesale'>Get Studio &amp; Bulk Pricing</a></div><ul class='ticks'><li>Free shipping on orders over $75</li><li>In-stock orders ship within 24 hours</li><li>30-day no-hassle returns &mdash; try it in your studio</li><li>Volume discounts start at just 6 units</li></ul><p class='muted' style='margin-top:18px'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> <b>4.8/5</b> from 12,000+ verified customer reviews</p></div><div class='tile'><span class='pill'>Best Seller &middot; Save 27%</span><span class='mark'>&#129496;</span><div><b style='font-size:19px'>Pro-Grip Studio Mat 6mm</b><br>Extra cushion, no-slip surface. <b>$39.95</b> <span style='text-decoration:line-through;opacity:.75'>$54.95</span><br><a class='btn btn-primary sm' style='margin-top:10px' href='/products/pro-grip-studio-mat'>See the mat</a></div></div></div></div><div class='trust'><div class='wrap trust-g'><div><b>25+ years</b><br>Serving the yoga community since 1999</div><div><b>5,000+ studios</b><br>Studios, gyms, schools &amp; retreats supplied</div><div><b>Ships in 24 hrs</b><br>From our US warehouse</div><div><b>30-day returns</b><br>Plus a 1-year defect guarantee</div></div></div><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Shop by category</h2><p class='sub'>Everything you need for one mat or one hundred.</p><div class='cats'><a class='cat' href='/shop'><span>&#129496;</span>Yoga Mats</a><a class='cat' href='/shop'><span>&#129355;</span>Blocks</a><a class='cat' href='/shop'><span>&#127882;</span>Straps</a><a class='cat' href='/shop'><span>&#128719;</span>Bolsters</a><a class='cat' href='/shop'><span>&#129525;</span>Blankets</a><a class='cat' href='/wholesale'><span>&#128230;</span>Studio Packs</a></div></div></section><section style='background:#fbfaf7'><div class='wrap'><h2>Best sellers this month</h2><p class='sub'>Ranked by real orders from studios and home practitioners.</p><div class='grid'><div class='card'><div class='ph'>&#129496;<span class='badge'>#1 Best Seller</span></div><div class='card-b'><h3>Pro-Grip Studio Yoga Mat &mdash; 6mm</h3><p class='muted'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4.9 (3,412)</p><p class='price'>$39.95 <span class='was'>$54.95</span></p><p class='save'>You save $15.00</p><button class='btn btn-dark' onclick='addToCart(\\\"Pro-Grip Studio Yoga Mat 6mm\\\",39.95)'>Add to cart</button><a class='muted' style='text-align:center;margin-top:6px' href='/products/pro-grip-studio-mat'>View details</a></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>&#127794;<span class='badge'>Eco</span></div><div class='card-b'><h3>Natural Cork &amp; Rubber Mat &mdash; 4mm</h3><p class='muted'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4.8 (1,105)</p><p class='price'>$59.95 <span class='was'>$79.00</span></p><p class='save'>You save $19.05</p><button class='btn btn-dark' onclick='addToCart(\\\"Natural Cork &amp; Rubber Mat 4mm\\\",59.95)'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>&#129355;<span class='badge'>Pair</span></div><div class='card-b'><h3>High-Density Foam Blocks (2-pack)</h3><p class='muted'><span class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</span> 4.9 (2,780)</p><p class='price'>$14.95 <span class='was'>$21.95</span></p><p class='save'>Volume pricing available</p><button class='btn btn-dark' onclick='addToCart(\\\"High-Density Foam Blocks 2-pack\\\",14.95)'>Add to cart</button></div></div><div class='card'><div class='ph'>&#128230;<span class='badge'>Studio favorite</span></div><div class='card-b'><h3>10-Person Studio Starter Pack</h3><p class='muted'>10 mats + 10 blocks + 10 straps</p><p class='price'>$499.00 <span class='was'>$679.00</span></p><p class='save'>Save $180 &middot; Free shipping</p><button class='btn btn-dark' onclick='addToCart(\\\"10-Person Studio Starter Pack\\\",499)'>Add to cart</button><a class='muted' style='text-align:center;margin-top:6px' href='/wholesale'>Need 50+? Get a quote</a></div></div></div><div style='text-align:center;margin-top:28px'><a class='btn btn-out' href='/shop'>View all products</a></div></div></section><section class='band'><div class='wrap'><h2>Buying for a studio, gym, school or event?</h2><p class='sub'>Volume discounts start at 6 units &mdash; no membership, no minimum contract. Tell us what you need and we will send a same-day quote.</p><div class='tiers'><div class='tier'><b>6+</b>units<br>Save 10%</div><div class='tier'><b>24+</b>units<br>Save 18%</div><div class='tier'><b>50+</b>units<br>Save 25%</div><div class='tier'><b>100+</b>units<br>Custom pricing + logo printing</div></div><div class='cta-row'><a class='btn btn-primary' href='/wholesale'>Request a free quote</a><a class='btn' style='background:rgba(255,255,255,.15);color:#fff' href='tel:18005550199'>Call (800) 555-0199</a></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><h2>Why practitioners and studio owners buy direct</h2><p class='sub'>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country.</p><div class='rev'><div class='rq'><h3>We are the manufacturer</h3><p class='muted'>We manufacture and source our own goods, which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices &mdash; no middlemen adding markup.</p></div><div class='rq'><h3>Built for studio abuse</h3><p class='muted'>Our mats and props are specified for daily class use: closed-cell surfaces that wipe clean, blocks that keep their shape, straps that do not fray.</p></div><div class='rq'><h3>Growing the community</h3><p class='muted'>We have faithfully supplied the yoga community since 1999. When you shop with us you help grow your practice, your business, and yoga as a whole.</p></div></div></div></section><section style='background:#fbfaf7'><div class='wrap'><h2>What customers say</h2><p class='sub'>12,000+ reviews &middot; average rating 4.8/5</p><div class='rev'><div class='rq'><p class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p>&ldquo;We outfitted all 32 spots in our hot studio. Two years of daily classes and the mats still grip. Nothing else at this price lasted a season.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted'><b>Danielle R.</b> &mdash; Studio owner, Austin TX &middot; Verified buyer</p></div><div class='rq'><p class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p>&ldquo;Ordered Friday, teaching on it Monday. The 6mm mat is kinder to my knees than my old $90 mat.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted'><b>Marcus T.</b> &mdash; Home practitioner &middot; Verified buyer</p></div><div class='rq'><p class='stars'>&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</p><p>&ldquo;The bulk quote came back the same day and beat two other suppliers by 20%. Reordering for our second location.&rdquo;</p><p class='muted'><b>Priya S.</b> &mdash; Wellness director &middot; Verified buyer</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class='wrap'><div class='email'><h2>Get 10% off your first order</h2><p class='sub' style='margin-bottom:0'>Join 60,000+ yogis for restock alerts, teacher tips and subscriber-only deals.</p><form class='inline' onsubmit='return signup(event)'><input type='email' required placeholder='you@email.com' aria-label='Email address'><button class='btn btn-primary' type='submit'>Send my code</button></form><p class='muted' id='signupMsg'>No spam. Unsubscribe anytime.</p></div></div></section><section style='padding-top:0'><div class='wrap' style='max-width:820px'><h2>Shipping, returns &amp; bulk questions</h2><details><summary>How fast will my order ship?</summary><p class='muted'>In-stock orders placed before 2pm ET ship the same business day from our US warehouse. Most orders arrive in 2&ndash;5 business days.</p></details><details><summary>When is shipping free?</summary><p class='muted'>Free standard shipping on all US orders over $75. Studio packs and bulk orders over $499 always ship free.</p></details><details><summary>What is your return policy?</summary><p class='muted'>30 days, no hassle. If a product is not right for your practice or your studio, contact us for a return label. Manufacturing defects are covered for one full year.</p></details><details><summary>Do you offer studio, school or event pricing?</summary><p class='muted'>Yes. Discounts start at 6 units and reach 25%+ at 50 units, with custom logo printing available at 100+. <a href='/wholesale' style='color:#0f6b5c;font-weight:700'>Request a quote</a> or call (800) 555-0199.</p></details><details><summary>Can I get samples before a large order?</summary><p class='muted'>Absolutely. We ship discounted single samples to qualified studios and resellers before you commit to a full order.</p></details></div></section><footer><div class='wrap'><div class='fg'><div><div class='logo' style='color:#fff'>Yoga<span style='color:#8cc3b2'>Direct</span></div><p>Supplying the yoga community with mats, props and studio equipment at manufacturer-direct prices since 1999.</p><p><a href='tel:18005550199'><b style='color:#fff'>(800) 555-0199</b></a><br>Mon&ndash;Fri, 8am&ndash;6pm ET<br><a href='mailto:support@yogadirect.com'>support@yogadirect.com</a></p></div><div><h4>Shop</h4><ul><li><a href='/shop'>All products</a></li><li><a href='/products/pro-grip-studio-mat'>Yoga mats</a></li><li><a href='/shop'>Blocks &amp; straps</a></li><li><a href='/shop'>Bolsters &amp; blankets</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Business</h4><ul><li><a href='/wholesale'>Studio &amp; bulk pricing</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Request a quote</a></li><li><a href='/wholesale'>Custom logo printing</a></li></ul></div><div><h4>Help</h4><ul><li><a href='/about'>About us</a></li><li><a href='/about'>Contact</a></li><li><a href='/'>Shipping &amp; returns</a></li></ul></div></div><p class='muted' style='margin-top:28px;color:#7d9391'>&copy; 1999&ndash;2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. Secure checkout &middot; Visa &middot; Mastercard &middot; Amex &middot; PayPal &middot; Purchase orders accepted.</p></div></footer><div class='scrim' id='scrim' onclick='closeCart()'></div><aside class='drawer' id='drawer' aria-label='Cart'><div class='dh'><span>Your cart</span><button onclick='closeCart()' aria-label='Close'>&times;</button></div><div class='db'><p class='muted' id='shipMsg'></p><div class='track'><i id='shipBar'></i></div><div id='cartBody'></div></div><div class='df'><p style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;margin:0 0 10px'><span>Subtotal</span><span id='cartTotal'>$0.00</span></p><button class='btn btn-primary' style='width:100%' onclick='checkout()'>Secure checkout</button><p class='muted' style='text-align:center;margin:10px 0 0'>30-day returns &middot; Ships in 24 hrs</p></div></aside><div class='toast' id='toast'></div><script>var CART=[];try{CART=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('yd_cart')||'[]')}catch(e){CART=[]}function save(){try{localStorage.setItem('yd_cart',JSON.stringify(CART))}catch(e){}render()}function addToCart(n,p){CART.push({n:n,p:p});save();openCart();toast(n+' added to cart')}function removeItem(k){CART.splice(k,1);save()}function total(){return CART.reduce(function(s,x){return s+x.p},0)}function rend